ent-EncryptionKeyStationMasterReceiveOnly = station listening encryption key
    .desc = An encryption key that receives all eight station channels but cannot transmit on them.

ent-MercUndeterminedClass = mercenary specialization requisition
    .desc = Choose one mercenary specialization. Assault provides weapon requisitions, while Medic, Recon, Augment and Vanguard provide specialized equipment.
ent-MercUndeterminedAssaultWeapon = mercenary weapon requisition
    .desc = A small remote utilizing bluespace technology to drop in a weapon loadout directly to you. Choose wisely.
ent-ClothingBeltMercWebbingAssaultFilled = mercenary webbing
    .desc = Ideal for storing everything from ammo to weapons and combat essentials.
    .suffix = Assault, Filled
ent-ClothingBeltMercWebbingReconFilled = mercenary webbing
    .desc = Mercenary webbing stocked with shotgun shells for reconnaissance operations.
    .suffix = Recon, Filled
ent-ClothingBeltMercWebbingAugmentFilled = mercenary webbing
    .desc = Mercenary webbing stocked with Mk32 magazines and .45 magnum ammunition.
    .suffix = Augment, Filled
ent-ClothingBeltMercenaryMedical = mercenary medical webbing
    .desc = A mercenary chest rig with deep medical pouches, adapted from an ERT doctor's webbing.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsMercNoSlipFilled = mercenary boots
    .desc = Boots that have gone through many conflicts and that have proven their combat reliability. Their no-slip soles prevent slipping.
    .suffix = Filled
ent-MedkitCombatMercenaryFilled = combat medical kit
    .desc = A combat medical kit stocked with dressings, syringes and two combat medipens.
    .suffix = Mercenary, Filled
ent-MedkitCombatMercenaryMedicFilled = combat medical kit
    .desc = A combat medical kit stocked with dressings, syringes and a health analyzer. The medic's combat medipens are carried in medical webbing.
    .suffix = Mercenary Medic, Filled
ent-ClothingHandsMercGlovesMedical = mercenary medical gloves
    .desc = Insulated combat gloves with a medical-grade nitrile coating, combining surgical hygiene with protection from combat injuries and electricity.
ent-ClothingBackpackMercenaryMedicFilled = mercenary bag
    .desc = A mercenary backpack packed with chemical jugs, a hypospray and supplies for keeping a mercenary squad alive.
    .suffix = Medic, Filled
ent-AutosurgeonMedicalCyberneticEyes = syndicate autosurgeon (medical cybernetic eyes)
    .desc = A single-use autosurgeon loaded with medical cybernetic eyes featuring an integrated medical HUD.
ent-ClothingBackpackMercenaryFilled = mercenary bag
    .desc = A reliable combat backpack supplied with a medical kit and two explosive grenades.
    .suffix = Filled
ent-ClothingBackpackMercenaryVanguardFilled = mercenary bag
    .desc = A reliable combat backpack packed with a Vanguard's grenades, restraints, manual, boots and medical supplies.
    .suffix = Vanguard, Filled
ent-ClothingBackpackMercenaryAssaultFilled = mercenary bag
    .desc = A reliable combat backpack supplied with a medical kit, two explosive grenades and two C4 charges.
    .suffix = Assault, Filled

selectable-set-merc-assault-name = Assault
selectable-set-merc-assault-description = Frontline rifleman. Choose a primary and a sidearm from the requisitions in your webbing. The two C4 charges are for breaching.

selectable-set-merc-medic-name = Medic
selectable-set-merc-medic-description = Squad medic. Refill the hypospray from the jugs. The webbing holds medical gear only. The autosurgeon installs eyes with a built-in medical HUD.

selectable-set-merc-recon-name = Recon
selectable-set-merc-recon-description = Infiltrator. Carries a receive-only listening key and a suppressed shotgun for silent eliminations.

selectable-set-merc-augment-name = Augment
selectable-set-merc-augment-description = Cyber-enhanced close-quarters fighter. Install the mantis blade, Sandevistan and cyberdeck before contact.

selectable-set-merc-vanguard-name = Vanguard
selectable-set-merc-vanguard-description = Melee breacher. No-slip boots. Wield the katana with both hands to deflect blows and bullets.
